            "sid": "JER 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth owaco ran ama: Kidhi inyew jagi pa jacwec degi ma lowo nyamasiga. Kidhi gi jotel pa ji mogo kodi jocway ri Were i wi migam ma jotieko tic hongo m'oromo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.23.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Kerin 23:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.7.30+JER.7.31+JER.7.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 7:30-32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.32.34+JER.32.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "32:34-35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aka iwok gi milelo pa wod Hinom i kama donjo i waŋkac pa Potcad, aka ititi kenyo mikwenda m'abino waco rin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth owaco ran ni awaci ama: Winji win wac pa Rwoth, win kerin ma Yuda kodi ji ma bedo i Yerusalem. Rwoth pa lwak jolweny, Were pa Isiraili waco ama: Akidho kelo kidamba ma kiwacere kwoŋ kabedo me ma ithi kisi dhano m'owinji kwoŋe bino cwowo gi litho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akidho timo gime kwoŋbedo ji jojwangan, aka jotieko koco kabedo me gi miyo mic ri werin man i iye ma jo, kwarere pajo kosa kerin ma Yuda fodi jokuya; kodi kwoŋbedo jotieko poŋo kabedo me gi remo pa ji m'oneki jo m'ongoye gima jotimo marac, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.18.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jolevi 18:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aka jotieko geto migame ri Bal ma waŋo nyithindho pajo i mac paka mic awaŋa ri Bal, m'akiwaco rijo kendo akiyere gine, kosa k'obino kada i paro paran. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Riameno, adieri hongo bino, Rwoth waco, ma kabedo me doko k'olwoŋ ni Tofeth, kosa milelo pa wod Hinom, to milelo ma neki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I kabedo me can pa Joyuda kodi ji ma Yerusalem moro je ma jotimi latho gaya. Alaweyo jokwor pajo wokengila jo to joneko jo kama lweny ogunj'iye, kodi i cingi jono ma jodwaro kwo pajo. Alamiyo mulambin pajo paka cemo ri winyin ma koyo kodi ri ogwaŋe mager ma piny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alakelo rerok ma kiwacere kwoŋ tindi madwoŋ me ma kisi ŋat'okadhi je bino dhier to bwok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alamiyo jo camo delkwoŋ nyithindho pajo, aka joje jolacamo delkwoŋ wadi jo k'okar jo, kodi i litho ma jokwor pajo kodi jono ma jodwaro kwo pajo jomiyo jo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo ibino ŋinyo jagi ka jono ma jokadho kodin joneno, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aka ibino waco rijo ni: Rwoth Were pa lwak jolweny waco ama: “Ameno apaka bende alaturo ji me kodi tindi madwoŋ me, paka dhano ŋinyo gima jacwec degi ocweyo gi lowo nyamasiga, m'odoko kinyal mwono. I Tofeth, jolayikere to kabedo ma yikirok rumo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno apaka alatimo bende ri kabedo me, Rwoth waco, aka ri ji ma jobed'iye, k'aloko tindi madwoŋ me paka Tofeth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Udi ma Yerusalem kodi udi pa kerin ma Yuda ibino koco paka kabedo ma Tofeth, kodi i dier udi je ma wi kisul pajo otiek waŋ'iye buban ri micalin kodi kam'otiek konj'iye woko vini paka mic ri werin man.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo Yeremia odwoko wok Tofeth, kam'oyido odhir'iye go tuco wac pere, ocungo i kapido ma Ot pa Rwoth to waco ri ji je ni: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth pa lwak jolweny, Were pa Isiraili waco ama: “Pama onyo akelo kwoŋ tindi madwoŋ me kodi kwoŋ tindin mere je kidamba m'atieko tuco kwoŋe, rupiri wiy jo tek, jokwero winjo wac paran.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
